   "description": "Join us for a Special Steak Dinner Experience featuring our locally sourced steaks, butchered and aged in house. Steaks will be pre-selected by our team based on party size and current inventory. Steaks are $90 per pound and on average are 2.5-3.5 pounds each. Guests will be offered a tour of our BBQ pit to learn our steak smoking and grilling process. Steaks are cooked to temperature desired and served family style. Our servers can customize guest's experience at the time of arrival with appetizers, select BBQ meats, sides, dinner menu entrees, and desserts for an additional cost based on availability. <br />  <br />Wines by the glass, Special Wine Bottles, Local Beers and low ABV Cocktails can be ordered at the bar or from your server and are priced on the menu accordingly. We do NOT allow BYOB of any kind.  <br /><br />",
